<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Install VMP (iOS)</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: light dark;
        --bg: #0f1419;
        --card: #1a2332;
        --text: #e7ecf3;
        --muted: #9aa7b8;
        --accent: #111827;
        --accent-hover: #1f2937;
        --secondary: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        --secondary-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }
      main {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 420px;
        background: var(--card);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      }
      h1 {
        margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
        font-size: 1.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }
      .version {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      .install-btn {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: var(--accent);
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: center;
        text-decoration: none;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .install-btn:hover,
      .install-btn:focus {
        background: var(--accent-hover);
      }
      .secondary-btn {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        margin-top: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: var(--secondary);
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: center;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      .secondary-btn:hover,
      .secondary-btn:focus {
        background: var(--secondary-hover);
      }
      .notes {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        padding: 1rem;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .notes strong {
        color: var(--text);
      }
      .notes ul {
        margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
        padding-left: 1.2rem;
      }
      .notes li {
        margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      }
      .source-url {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        word-break: break-all;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
        border-radius: 8px;
        color: var(--muted);
      }
      .ota-note {
        margin-top: 1rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        line-height: 1.45;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>VMP</h1>
      <p class="version">Version __VERSION__</p>
      <div class="notes">
        <strong>SideStore / AltStore (recommended)</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Add this source URL in SideStore (includes all GitHub pre-releases):</li>
        </ul>
        <code class="source-url">__ALTSTORE_SOURCE_URL__</code>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem">
          No Mac required — SideStore re-signs the IPA from GitHub Releases using your Apple ID.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a class="secondary-btn" href="__INSTALL_URL__">Install via OTA (advanced)</a>
      <p class="ota-note">
        OTA install is secondary. It requires a properly signed distribution or ad-hoc provisioning profile;
        CI test IPAs are ad-hoc signed for SideStore, so OTA may fail unless you have matching device provisioning.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
